+// spaces B41-B43 (the owner, 2026-10-24): Edit Space, a window of its own for
+// a Space's name, its icon -- any emoji -- and its colour, one colour for both
+// looks or one for each, with a picture of the sidebar in each look. Done
+// applies all of it at once; Cancel and Esc leave the Space as it was.
+class EditSpaceView : public views::View, public views::TextfieldController {
